<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 177 ALL OUT V INDIA (237).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 177 ALL OUT V INDIA (237).</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were all out for 177 in reply to India's first innings total of 237 on the second day of the third and final cricket test on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 237 (S.Tendulkar 61, W.Raman 57; P.Adams 6-55), South Africa 177 (A.Kumble 4-71, J.Srinath 3-42).</p>
